{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"authoring","lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"《天净沙·秋思》：意象怎样一步步组合出游子之情","goals":["辨认诗中的关键意象","理解意象组合形成的环境氛围","分析“断肠人”与眼前景物的对照","沿着文本证据推导游子的情感"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["按文本顺序逐层累积意象","先观察景物特征，再归纳氛围与情感","用对照关系解释情感为何加深"],"context_refs":["learner_request"]}},"steps":[{"key":"step-images","purpose":"依照诗句顺序辨认关键意象，并观察每组意象携带的特征。","beats":[{"key":"beat-autumn-images","say":"你一向不擅长从意象推导情感，所以我会特别慢地讲。开头先摆出“枯藤、老树、昏鸦”。“枯”“老”“昏”都带着衰败、迟暮和暗淡的意味，三项连在一起，眼前的秋景便显得萧瑟而沉郁。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"withered-vine","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"枯藤","feature":"枯败、缺少生机"},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"main-board","align":"start"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"old-tree","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"老树","feature":"衰老、迟暮"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"withered-vine","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"evening-crow","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"昏鸦","feature":"暮色中的归鸦，色调暗淡"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"old-tree","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"group","when":"after_speech","as":"bleak-images","role":"imagery-cluster","label":"萧瑟的秋景","members":["withered-vine","old-tree","evening-crow"]},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"bleak-images","emphasis":"突出“枯—老—昏”共同造成的衰败、暗淡感"}]},{"key":"beat-home-images","say":"接着出现“小桥、流水、人家”。这组景物尺度小、有人居住，带来安静、温暖的生活气息；它不是孤立的美景，而是在萧瑟秋景中嵌入一个可归宿的画面。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"small-bridge","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"小桥","feature":"小巧、安静"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"withered-vine","align":"start","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"flowing-water","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"流水","feature":"平和、流动"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"small-bridge","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"homes","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"人家","feature":"有人居住，具有温暖的生活气息"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"flowing-water","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"group","when":"after_speech","as":"home-images","role":"imagery-cluster","label":"可归宿的生活图景","members":["small-bridge","flowing-water","homes"]},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"home-atmosphere","kind":"note","role":"atmosphere","content":{"text":"安静、温暖、有生活气息"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"home-images","align":"center","gap":"compact"}}]}]},{"key":"step-road","purpose":"补入旅途意象，看到环境怎样由静态秋景转向游子的现实处境。","beats":[{"key":"beat-travel-images","say":"“古道、西风、瘦马”把视线转到旅途。“古道”漫长荒凉，“西风”寒凉肃杀，“瘦马”显出跋涉的疲惫；环境不再只是秋天的背景，也开始具体包围并压迫赶路的人。","delivery":"emphatic","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"ancient-road","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"古道","feature":"漫长、荒凉的旅途"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"small-bridge","align":"start","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"west-wind","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"西风","feature":"寒凉、肃杀"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"ancient-road","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"thin-horse","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"瘦马","feature":"长期跋涉后的疲惫"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"west-wind","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"group","when":"after_speech","as":"travel-images","role":"imagery-cluster","label":"寒凉而疲惫的旅途","members":["ancient-road","west-wind","thin-horse"]},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"travel-atmosphere","kind":"note","role":"atmosphere","content":{"text":"荒凉 + 寒冷 + 疲惫：景物开始显出赶路者的处境"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"travel-images","align":"center","gap":"compact"}}]},{"key":"beat-atmosphere-builds","say":"三组意象按顺序叠加：先是衰败暗淡的秋景，再闪出温暖的人家，随后落到寒冷疲惫的旅途。于是整体氛围不只是“悲秋”，而是一个孤身旅人看见归宿、却仍在荒凉路上的处境。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"bleak-to-home","from":"bleak-images","to":"home-images","relation":"由萧瑟秋景转入温暖归宿的短暂映照"},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"home-to-travel","from":"home-images","to":"travel-images","relation":"由可归宿的生活图景转回寒凉疲惫的现实旅途"},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"combined-atmosphere","kind":"diagram","role":"reasoning-chain","content":{"sequence":["衰败暗淡的秋景","温暖可归的人家","寒冷疲惫的旅途"],"result":"孤身旅人看见归宿，却仍在荒凉路上"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"travel-images","align":"center","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"focus","when":"after_speech","targets":["bleak-images","home-images","travel-images","bleak-to-home","home-to-travel"],"intent":"呈现三组意象逐层组合成环境氛围的过程"}]}]},{"key":"step-contrast","purpose":"分析“断肠人”与眼前景物的对照，说明情感为何在结尾集中爆发。","beats":[{"key":"beat-sunset","say":"“夕阳西下”补上时间压力：白昼即将结束，暮色更深，而旅人仍没有抵达归宿。它把开头“昏鸦”的暗淡推进到即将入夜，也让漂泊处境更紧迫。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"setting-sun","kind":"text","role":"imagery","content":{"text":"夕阳西下","feature":"白昼将尽，暮色加深"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"travel-images","align":"start","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"connect","when":"after_speech","as":"dusk-deepens","from":"evening-crow","to":"setting-sun","relation":"从昏暗的归鸦推进到白昼将尽"},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"time-pressure","kind":"note","role":"inference","content":{"text":"天色将晚，而旅人仍未归宿：漂泊感与紧迫感加深"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"setting-sun","align":"center","gap":"normal"}}]},{"key":"beat-heartbroken-traveler","say":"最后才点出“断肠人在天涯”。“断肠人”不是突然贴上的主题标签：他的前景有归巢的昏鸦和有人居住的“人家”，他自己却骑着瘦马停留在古道与天涯。别人或动物可归、眼前人家可居，与自己无家可归形成强烈对照，思乡与孤独因此集中显现。","delivery":"emphatic","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"heartbroken-traveler","kind":"text","role":"human-presence","content":{"text":"断肠人在天涯","position":"远离故乡，仍在漂泊"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"setting-sun","align":"start","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"crow-traveler-contrast","from":"evening-crow","to":"heartbroken-traveler","relation":"昏鸦似可归巢，游子却仍漂泊"},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"home-traveler-contrast","from":"homes","to":"heartbroken-traveler","relation":"眼前有人家可居，游子却远在天涯"},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"horse-traveler-link","from":"thin-horse","to":"heartbroken-traveler","relation":"瘦马的疲态映照游子长期跋涉的疲惫"},{"do":"write","when":"after_speech","as":"contrast-result","kind":"note","role":"emotional-inference","content":{"evidence":"可归的昏鸦与人家，对照仍在古道天涯的断肠人","emotion":"思乡、孤独、漂泊无归之痛"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"heartbroken-traveler","align":"center","gap":"spacious"}},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"home-traveler-contrast","emphasis":"突出“眼前有家”与“自己无归”的核心对照"}]}]},{"key":"step-evidence","purpose":"把意象、氛围、处境和情感连成完整的文本证据链。","beats":[{"key":"beat-evidence-chain","say":"从文本证据走向情感，可以沿着这条链条：枯、老、昏造成衰败暗淡；小桥流水人家显出可归的温暖；古道西风瘦马呈现寒凉疲惫；夕阳西下又加深未归的紧迫；这些景物共同围住“天涯”的断肠人，才支持我们读出思乡、孤独和漂泊无归之痛。","delivery":"encouraging","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"evidence-chain","kind":"diagram","role":"text-to-emotion-reasoning","content":{"stages":[{"text":"枯藤、老树、昏鸦","effect":"衰败暗淡"},{"text":"小桥、流水、人家","effect":"温暖而可归"},{"text":"古道、西风、瘦马","effect":"寒凉、荒远、疲惫"},{"text":"夕阳西下","effect":"天晚未归，紧迫加深"},{"text":"断肠人在天涯","effect":"思乡、孤独、漂泊无归之痛集中显现"}]},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"summary-board","align":"start"}},{"do":"connect","when":"after_speech","as":"atmosphere-to-traveler","from":"combined-atmosphere","to":"heartbroken-traveler","relation":"层层累积的环境氛围具体化为游子的漂泊处境"},{"do":"connect","when":"after_speech","as":"traveler-to-emotion","from":"heartbroken-traveler","to":"contrast-result","relation":"无家可归的对照支持思乡、孤独与悲痛的情感判断"},{"do":"focus","when":"after_speech","targets":["evidence-chain","atmosphere-to-traveler","traveler-to-emotion"],"intent":"收束为从意象证据到环境、处境和情感的完整推导"}]}]}],"close":{"summary":"全曲不是先宣布“游子悲秋”，而是让枯藤老树昏鸦、小桥流水人家、古道西风瘦马和夕阳依次出现：萧瑟背景中嵌入可归的温暖，再回到寒凉疲惫的旅途；当“断肠人”现身时，可归的昏鸦与人家便反衬他的天涯漂泊。思乡、孤独与无归之痛，是由这些文本证据一步步推导出来的。","focus":["evidence-chain","heartbroken-traveler","home-traveler-contrast","traveler-to-emotion"]}}
